    "checker_defects": [
      "The flight named a flyer late home only in a window that crossed an episode's end: every window was 600 steps from step 0 and an episode is 3,000, so no window crossed one and the late list was always empty, and the rule every-flyer-home was never tested.",
      "The checker skipped the move into an episode's first step, where the flight puts a late flyer back home, so a jump home of up to 15 m through a crown was never a move it checked; and it checked each window alone, so no move between two windows was checked either.",
      "The checker let a flyer landing on, perching at or taking off from a perch pass every solid cell the flight's column called the perch's own, and the column called every solid cell above a perch its own, whichever object filled it."
