    "limits": [
      "Request cost timed the flight module's flight_window alone, cold, from an episode's genesis: a request's database reads, composing the air and answering are not in it. The first request cost run started with a one-minute load of 8.6, just after a full suite; quiet-slot asks for a repeat above 8, and the repeat started at 18.1, a burst the idle gate did not see; both are given, and their medians differ by at most 2 percent.",
      "Only the cold path was judged. A page reads windows in order, each resumed from the one before, which computes 600 steps; that path was not timed here.",
      "performance.now() resolves to 100 microseconds in these pages, so every frame figure is a multiple of 100.",
      "No arm moves the camera, so at any moment some of the 24 birds are out of view.",
      "One machine and one browser.",
      "The corrected check also found every move that brought a point flyer's body within half its span of a part (bodies_meeting_a_part): the first registration's rules are about points, so that count judges nothing here, and it is why the air is grown now."
